msgstr "Scenár 3: Červená čiapočka"

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/achievements.cfg:29
msgid "Complete <i>Lee Shore</i> without freeing any slaves."
msgstr "Dokonči scenár <i>Záveterné pobrežie</i> bez oslobodenia otrokov."

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/achievements.cfg:29
msgid "Scenario 4: Tunnel Vision"
msgstr "Scenár 4: Tunelové videnie"

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/achievements.cfg:30
msgid "Scenario 5: Vendetta"
msgstr "Scenár 5: Odplata"

#. [achievement_group]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/achievements.cfg:30
msgid "Strike the final blow in <i>Lady Maudie</i> with Thea."
msgstr "Zasaď posledný úder <i>Laddy Maudie</i> s Theou."

#. [scenario]: id=01_Pirates
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:9
msgid "Pirates!"
msgstr "Piráti!"

#. [part]
#. S01 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:27
msgid ""
"Far north from Westin, on the west coast of the Kingdom of Wesnoth, there "
"lies a place called the Bay of Pearls. The waters of the bay are calm, and "
"clear, and warm even in winter. But its most notable feature is that for "
"which it is named — abundant beds of oysters and a vast wealth in pearls."
msgstr ""
"Ďaleko na sever od Westinu, na západnom pobreží Wesnothského kráľovstva, sa "
"nachádza miesto zvané Perlová zátoka. Vody zátoky sú pokojné, priezračné a "
"teplé aj v zime. Jej najvýznamnejšou vlastnosťou je však to, podľa čoho "
"dostala svoje meno. Bohaté ustricové loviská a obrovské bohatstvo v perlách."

#. [part]
#. S01 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:32
msgid ""
"Many have tried to claim the bay for their own; sometimes with words, and "
"sometimes with swords. But in the end the Crown declared it the domain of "
"the merfolk, those most suited to care for and harvest the bay’s undersea "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"Mnohí sa pokúšali vyhlásiť zátoku za svoju. Niekedy slovami, inokedy mečom. "
"Nakoniec ju však Koruna vyhlásila za doménu vodných ľudí, ktorí boli "
"najspôsobilejší starať sa o podmorské bohatstvo zátoky a loviť ho."

#. [part]
#. S01 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:37
msgid ""
"Attracted by the temperate climate and easily-accessible wealth, a large and "
"thriving community of mermen quickly sprang up along the bay’s eastern coast."
msgstr ""
"Prilákaná miernym podnebím a ľahko dostupným bohatstvom sa pozdĺž východného "
"pobrežia zátoky rýchlo rozrástla veľká a prosperujúca komunita vodných ľudí."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:39
msgid ""
"Along the west coast, where the pearls were less plentiful, hardy clans of "
"human fishers and farmers began to settle. Though not wealthy — at least not "
"compared with their merfolk neighbors — the human hamlets afforded a simple, "
"secure life for those disinterested in the wider kingdom’s hustle and bustle."
msgstr ""
"Pozdĺž západného pobrežia, kde perál nebolo až tak veľa, sa začali usádzať "
"húževnaté rody ľudských rybárov a roľníkov. Hoci v porovnaní so svojimi "
"susedmi z radov vodných ľudí neboli také bohaté, tak ľudské osady ponúkali "
"jednoduchý a bezpečný život pre tých, ktorí nestáli o ruch a zhon kráľovstva."

#. [part]
#. S01 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:44
msgid ""
"But for every man content with a quiet life, there is another who seeks to "
"take it from him..."
msgstr ""
"No na každého človeka spokojného s pokojným životom pripadá iný, ktorý sa mu "
"ho snaží vziať..."

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:65
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:69
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:94
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:67
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:92
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:111
msgid "Corsairs"
msgstr "Korzári"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:89
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:85
msgid "Rochelm"
msgstr "Rochelm"

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. notice that appears at the beginning of the scenario if you select Deadly difficulty
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:99
msgid ""
"NOTE: ‘Deadly’ difficulty is intended to be a moderate challenge even for "
"experienced players! If you’re new to Wesnoth, I strongly suggest trying a "
"lower difficulty."
msgstr ""
"POZNÁMKA: „Smrtiaca“ náročnosť je navrhnutá tak, aby bola výzvou aj pre "
"skúsených hráčov! Ak si vo Wesnothe nováčik, dôrazne odporúčame skúsiť "
"nižšiu náročnosť."

#. [set_menu_item]: id=tutorial_toggle_on
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:109
msgid "Tip Dialogue &amp; Popups: On"
msgstr "Dialógové a vyskakovacie okná s tipmi: Zapnuté"

#. [set_menu_item]: id=tutorial_toggle_off
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:121
msgid "Tip Dialogue &amp; Popups: Off"
msgstr "Dialógové a vyskakovacie okná s tipmi: Vypnuté"

#. [message]: role=fisher
#. a peasant is running towards town, calling out to the village leader
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:167
msgid "Alderman! Alderman Rael!"
msgstr "Rychtár! Rychtár Rael!"

#. [message]: role=fisher
#. a peasant is running towards town, calling out to the village leader
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:173
msgid ""
"(panting) Pirates! Alderman, it’s pirates! Burned my farm... (pant) Stole my "
"skiff... (pant) Thought you should know..."
msgstr ""
"(lapá po dychu) Piráti! Rychtár, sú to piráti! Vypálili moju farmu... (lapá "
"po dychu) Ukradli môj čln... (lapá po dychu) Myslel som, že by ste to mali "
"vedieť..."

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:188
msgid "Pirates? What, here?!"
msgstr "Piráti? Čože? Tu?!"

#. [event]
#. this is a fishing boat name, and a pun on the phrase "seize the day"
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:196
msgid "Seas the Day"
msgstr "Morský deň"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:198
msgid "Boryn"
msgstr "Boryn"

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:206
msgid ""
"Blast! Haven’t seen outlaws in these parts since I were a lad... these ones "
"even dare to leave their faces uncovered. What do you make of it, Thea?"
msgstr ""
"Do kelu! V týchto končinách som nevidel zbojníkov od čias, čo som bol "
"chlapec... títo sa dokonca odvažujú nechať si odhalené tváre. Čo si o tom "
"myslíš, Thea?"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:210
msgid ""
"I don’t know, Father. This is a strange thing. These outlaws couldn’t’ve "
"come from the other villages — the other aldermen won’t stand for "
"troublemakers."
msgstr ""
"Neviem, otče. Je to čudná vec. Títo zbojníci nemohli prísť z druhých dedín, "
"ostatní rychtári by výtržníkov netolerovali."

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#. "waxed" can be substituted with any other kind of routine bow maintenance
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:215
msgid ""
"Well, it’s a good thing I’ve been keeping my old war-bow waxed. There’s "
"nothing for it but to drive them off. Constable Elyn, report!"
msgstr ""
"Nuž, ešteže som sa o svoj starý vojnový luk dobre staral. Neostáva nič iné, "
"len ich zahnať. Strážca Elyn, hláste sa!"

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#. Elyn has just been woken up, and is getting ready to help fight a battle
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:230
msgid "(yawn) It’s too early for this, Pa..."
msgstr "(zíva) Na toto je príliš skoro..."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:234
msgid ""
"I’ll get to our keep and rally the farmers too; get a posse together. It’ll "
"take more than the three of us to win this fight."
msgstr ""
"Pôjdem do našej pevnosti a zmobilizujem aj farmárov, zostavím skupinu.. Na "
"víťazstvo v tomto boji budeme potrebovať viac než len nás troch."

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:240
msgid ""
"Well done for taking the initiative, Thea. Let’s show these pirates what we "
"stand for. What do you say, lads?"
msgstr ""
"Výborne, že si prevzala iniciatívu, Thea. Ukážme týmto pirátom, s kým si "
"začali. Čo poviete, chlapi?"

#. [message]: role=fisher
#. [message]: speaker=Lookout
#. [message]: race=human
#. The speaker is shouting a cheer and preparing to attack his enemy. Can be translated into any kind of cheer, but please stay consistent with the other instances of "Rah!"
#. The speaker is shouting a cheer and preparing to attack his enemy. Can be translated into any kind of cheer, but please stay consistent with the other instances of "Rah!"
#. The speaker is shouting a cheer and preparing to attack his enemy. Can be translated into any kind of cheer, but please stay consistent with the other instances of "Rah!"
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:245
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:137
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:475
msgid "Rah!"
msgstr "Hurá!"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:253
msgid "Defeat the enemy leader"
msgstr "Porazte nepriateľského vodcu"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:257
msgid "Death of Thea, Rael, or Elyn"
msgstr "Smrť Thei, Raela alebo Elyna"

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:278
msgid ""
"(whistles) There’s more of them than I expected. We’re going to be "
"outnumbered until we have the time and gold to rally a larger force."
msgstr ""
"(pískne) Je ich viac, než som čakal. Budú mať prevahu, kým nebudeme mať čas "
"a zlato na zozbieranie väčšej sily."

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:281
msgid "Fighting from a Disadvantage"
msgstr "Boj v nevýhode"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:282
msgid ""
"Your enemy in this scenario starts with much more gold than you.\n"
"Even worse, your only recruit options are Peasants and Woodsmen:\n"
"cheap-but-frail fighters with makeshift weapons and minimal \n"
"training. Peasants and Woodsmen are level 0 units, and as such \n"
"do not enforce a Zone of Control (enemies can move freely around \n"
"them without being stopped).\n"
"\n"
"Fortunately, you’re much smarter than our AI (probably), and this \n"
"scenario has a generous turn limit. Don’t sacrifice your entire \n"
"army right away. Play smart — control villages to gain gold and \n"
"use the time of day to your advantage. <i><b>Slowly build up your army\n"
"while whittling down the opponent’s.</b></i>"
msgstr ""
"Tvoj nepriateľ v tomto scenári začína s oveľa väčším množstvom zlata než "
"ty.\n"
"Čo je ešte horšie, tvoja jediná možnosť naverbovania sú sedliaci a horali:\n"
"lacní, no krehkí bojovníci s improvizovanými zbraňami a minimálnym\n"
"výcvikom. farmári a drevorubači sú jednotky úrovne 0, a preto\n"
"neuplatňujú zónu kontroly (nepriatelia sa okolo nich môžu voľne pohybovať\n"
"bez zastavenia).\n"
"\n"
"Našťastie si oveľa múdrejší než naša AI (pravdepodobne) a tento\n"
"scenár má veľkorysý limit kôl. Neobetuj celú svoju armádu\n"
"hneď na začiatku. Hraj rozumne. Ovládaj dediny, aby si získal zlato, a\n"
"využívaj dennú dobu vo svoj prospech. <i><b>Pomaly buduj svoju armádu\n"
"a zároveň postupne oslabuj súperovu.</b></i>"

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:297
msgid ""
"We’ll need more experienced fighters, too. You’ve done your best to train me "
"and Thea, Pa, but most of the farmers are just that... farmers."
msgstr ""
"Budeme potrebovať aj skúsenejších bojovníkov. Robil si, čo si mohol, aby si "
"nás s Theou vycvičil, otec, ale väčšina farmárov sú len... farmári."

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:300
msgid "Experience Per Kill"
msgstr "Skúsenosti za zabitie"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:301
msgid ""
"Peasants and Woodsmen may be weak, but they also require little experience\n"
"to advance to the next level. Units gain 8 XP per level of the opponent "
"they \n"
"kill (e.g. 16 XP for killing a level 2 opponent). Killing a level 0 "
"opponent \n"
"grants 4 XP.\n"
"\n"
"Even if units don’t kill their opponent, they still gain XP just for "
"attacking:\n"
"0 XP for attacking a level 0 opponent, 1 XP for attacking a level 1 "
"opponent, etc."
msgstr ""
"Sedliaci a horali môžu byť slabí, ale vyžadujú si aj málo skúseností\n"
"na postup na ďalšiu úroveň. Jednotky získavajú 8 XP za každú úroveň "
"nepriateľa, ktorého\n"
"zabijú (napr. 16 XP za zabitie nepriateľa 2. úrovne). Zabitie nepriateľa 0. "
"úrovne\n"
"dáva 4 XP.\n"
"\n"
"Aj keď jednotky nezabijú svojho nepriateľa, stále získavajú XP za samotný "
"útok:\n"
"0 XP za útok na nepriateľa 0. úrovne, 1 XP za útok na nepriateľa 1. úrovne "
"atď."

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#. Elyn has just defeated a bandit
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:327
msgid "Take that! Don’t mess with Rochelm!"
msgstr "Tu máš! S Rochelmom sa nezahrávaj!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. The bandit is dying, and is insulting his killers. "leeches" means that the "pearl-folk" (the people living around the Bay of Pearls) didn't earn the pearls.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:365
msgid ""
"Pfft. You’re just leeches... All you pearl-folk are. You’ll get... what’s "
"coming to you..."
msgstr ""
"Pfft. Ste len pijavice... Všetci vy perlovci. Dostanete... čo vám patrí..."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:385
msgid "Well, that sounded ominous."
msgstr "Nuž, to znelo hrozivo."

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:391
msgid "Crier"
msgstr "Hlásnik"

#. [message]: speaker=Crier
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:395
msgid "Hear ye! Word from Weldyn! I bring a proclamation from King Garard!"
msgstr "Čujte, čujte! Správa z Weldynu! Prinášam vyhlásenie kráľa Gararda!"

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:399
msgid "Oh? Fortunate timing. Mayhaps this will explain our bandit attack."
msgstr "Fíha. Šťastne načasované. Možno to vysvetlí tento útok banditov."

#. [message]: speaker=Crier
#. "goodman" is an archaic term of respect, similar to "good sir".
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:404
msgid "No news of outlaws, goodman. Ahem..."
msgstr "Žiadne správy o banditoch, dobrý muž. Ehm..."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. a crier is reading from a scroll
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:411
msgid ""
"In the interest of common defense and the clearing of new lands, His Majesty "
"Garard, second of that name, calls forth a force of stout-hearted men to "
"wage war against the orcs of the north, being those who have long-threatened "
"our home."
msgstr ""
"V záujme spoločnej obrany a zúrodňovania nových krajín, Jeho Veličenstvo "
"Garard, druhý tohto mena, zvoláva silu zdatných mužov do boja proti orkom zo "
"severu, ktorí už dlho ohrozujú náš domov."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. a crier is reading from a scroll
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:418
msgid ""
"Of-age free men holding in excess of ten acres are obligated to purchase "
"spear, shield, helmet, and knife, and shall report for muster at the "
"fortress of Halstead within five weeks time."
msgstr ""
"Plnoletí slobodní muži vlastniaci viac ako desať akrov sú povinní zaobstarať "
"si kopiju, štít, prilbu a nôž a do piatich týždňov sa hláste na zhromaždenie "
"v pevnosti Halstead."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#. a crier is reading from a scroll
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:425
msgid ""
"Hear and obey.\n"
"\n"
"— His Majesty Garard II, King of Wesnoth"
msgstr ""
"Vypočuť a uposlúchnuť.\n"
"\n"
"— Jeho Veličenstvo Garard II., kráľ Wesnothu"

#. [message]: speaker=Crier
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:431
msgid "The message is given. Onwards to the next village."
msgstr "Odkaz je odovzdaný. Vpred do ďalšej dediny."

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:440
msgid "Ten acres... well, that’d be most of us. Blimey. But it is our duty."
msgstr ""
"Desať akrov... nuž, to by bola väčšina z nás. Ach jaj. Ale je to naša "
"povinnosť."

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:444
msgid ""
"You’re leading the village to war? But you’re our only veteran fighter. What "
"will we do if the outlaws come back?"
msgstr ""
"Vedieš dedinu do vojny? Ale ty si náš jediný skúsený bojovník. Čo budeme "
"robiť, ak sa banditi vrátia?"

#. [message]: speaker=Rael
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:448
msgid ""
"I have faith in you, son. Take good care of your sister. The lads and I will "
"return before you know it."
msgstr ""
"Verím ti, synak. Dobre sa staraj o sestru. Chlapi a ja sa vrátime ani sa "
"nenazdáš."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:466
msgid ""
"This battle is dragging on... if we can’t finish off these pirates soon, we "
"won’t have enough spare hands to bring in the harvest."
msgstr ""
"Tento boj sa vlečie... ak týchto pirátov čoskoro nedorazíme, nebudeme mať "
"dostatok voľných rúk na zber úrody."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/01_Pirates.cfg:473
msgid ""
"Brr, it’s starting to snow and we’re still stuck fighting. Our crops are all "
"dead! Even if we win this battle, we’ll be sure to starve during the "
"winter..."
msgstr ""
"Brr, začína snežiť a my sme stále zakliesnení v boji. Naša úroda je zničená! "
"Aj keď tento boj vyhráme, cez zimu určite pomrieme hladom..."

#. [scenario]: id=02_Swimming_with_Serpents
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:9
msgid "Swimming with Serpents"
msgstr "Plávanie s hadmi"

#. [part]
#. S02 intro. Alderman Rael left the village months ago, and has not returned.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:24
msgid ""
"But Rael did not return. Autumn turned to winter, winter to spring, and "
"trouble once again returned to the Peninsula of Pearls."
msgstr ""
"Rael sa však nevrátil. Jeseň sa prehupla do zimy, zima do jari a na Perlový "
"polostrov sa opäť vrátili problémy."

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:56
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:72
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:115
msgid "Naga"
msgstr "Hadí človek"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:88
msgid "Lookout"
msgstr "Hliadka"

#. [message]: speaker=Lookout
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:104
msgid ""
"Constable Elyn, sir! Ship on the horizon! I don’t recognize the trim... and "
"it has black sails!"
msgstr ""
"Strážca Elyn, pane! Loď na obzore! Nespoznávam ju... a má čierne plachty!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:108
msgid "Pirates again? Why has the Crown not dealt with this!"
msgstr "Zase piráti? Prečo to Koruna nevyriešila!"

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:112
msgid ""
"I’m sure Pa would’ve told the army about the thieves who attacked us. The "
"lords must be too busy to pay any mind to free-holds like us. But maybe the "
"merfolk—"
msgstr ""
"Som si istý, že otec povedal armáde o zlodejoch, ktorí nás napadli. Lordi "
"musia byť príliš zaneprázdnení, než aby venovali pozornosť slobodným "
"usadlostiam ako sme my. Ale možno vodní ľudia—"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#. Maudie is speaking to adults, not children. "Children" is used in a demeaning way here.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:128
msgid ""
"Hello, children. This is a shakedown. Empty your treasury or we’ll come and "
"take the pearls ourselves."
msgstr ""
"Zdravím, maličkí. Toto je prepadnutie. Vyprázdnite svoju pokladnicu, lebo si "
"prídeme po perly sami."

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:132
msgid "Pirate filth. Like hell you will. What do you say, lads?"
msgstr "Pirátska špina. Ani náhodou. Čo poviete, chlapi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:141
msgid "Charming. My new allies will make short work of you."
msgstr "Očarujúce. Moji noví spojenci s vami urobia krátky proces."

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:148
msgid "Pseail"
msgstr "Pseail"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:159
msgid "Briloss"
msgstr "Briloss"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:165
msgid "Hisss... We are ready, Missstresss."
msgstr "Sssme pripravení, pani."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:169
msgid ""
"Kill their warriors, then shackle the others and march them north. I’ve more "
"important places to be. Ta ta!"
msgstr ""
"Zabite ich bojovníkov, potom ostatných spútajte a odveďte na sever. Mám "
"dôležitejšie veci na práci. Zbohom!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:179
msgid "Snake monsters! The pirates have brought naga!"
msgstr "Hadie príšery! Piráti priviedli hadích ľudí!"

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:183
msgid ""
"Curse it all! Thea, rally the farmers and keep yourself safe. I’ve got to "
"take the old skiff and warn the merfolk that naga are here."
msgstr ""
"Do pekla s nimi! Thea, zhromaždi dedinčanov a udržuj ich v bezpečí. Musím si "
"zobrať ten starý čln a varovať vodných ľudí, že sú tu hadí ľudia."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:187
msgid ""
"Rally the farmers? What farmers? Most of our fighting-age men are away with "
"Dad."
msgstr ""
"Zhromaždiť dedinčanov? Akých dedinčanov? Väčšina našich bojaschopných mužov "
"je preč s otcom."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:195
msgid "Manpower Shortage"
msgstr "Nedostatok ľudí"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:196
msgid ""
"Peasants and Woodsmen cost twice as much to recruit (but not to recall)."
msgstr ""
"Sedliaci a horali stoja dvakrát viac pri naverbovaní (ale nie pri privolaní)."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:200
msgid ""
"Besides, the army hasn’t helped us. What makes you think the merfolk will?"
msgstr "Okrem toho, armáda nám nepomohla. Prečo si myslíš, že vodní ľudia áno?"

#. [message]: speaker=Elyn
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:204
msgid ""
"Merfolk are ancient enemies of the naga, and are part of the kingdom just "
"the same as us. They’ll help us, but I have to get the word out!"
msgstr ""
"Vodní ľudia sú starobylí nepriatelia hadích ľudí a sú súčasťou kráľovstva "
"rovnako ako my. Pomôžu nám, ale musíme povedať o útoku!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:213
msgid ""
"First Dad leaves, then my brother... It was nice while it lasted. I guess "
"it’s up to me now."
msgstr ""
"Najprv odíde otec, potom môj brat... Boli to pekné časy. Zrejme je to teraz "
"na mne."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:221
msgid ""
"Survive until reinforcements arrive at the east edge of the map on turn 13"
msgstr "Preži, kým na východný okraj mapy v 13. kole nedorazia posily"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:225
msgid "Then, defeat the enemy leaders"
msgstr "Potom poraz nepriateľských vodcov"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:229
msgid "Death of Thea"
msgstr "Smrť Thei"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:250
msgid ""
"Careful, everyone. Naga are powerful in water, but clumsier than we are on "
"land. Don’t fight on the coast. Flee inland if we need to, and then cut them "
"to pieces!"
msgstr ""
"Dávajte všetci pozor. Hadí ľudia sú silní vo vode, ale na súši sú "
"nemotornejší ako my. Nebojujte na pobreží. Ak treba, utečte do vnútrozemia a "
"potom ich rozsekajte na kusy!"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:253
msgid "Mixed Terrain"
msgstr "Zmiešaný terén"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:254
msgid ""
"Some hexes are <i><b>mixtures of multiple terrain types.</b></i> Bridges, "
"for example,\n"
"count as both shallow water and flat land — whichever is better for the \n"
"unit passing through.\n"
"\n"
"If you’re confused about a unit’s defense (chance to evade) or movement \n"
"on a particular hex and want to see exactly what terrains are included,\n"
"right-click the hex and select <i>Terrain Description</i>."
msgstr ""
"Niektoré polia sú <i><b>zmesou viacerých typov terénu.</b></i> Napríklad "
"mosty.\n"
"Počítajú sa ako plytká voda aj plochá zem. Podľa toho, čo je lepšie pre\n"
"prechádzajúcu jednotku.\n"
"\n"
"Ak máš pochybnosti o obrane jednotky (šanci na vyhnutie) alebo pohybe\n"
"na určitom poli a chceš vidieť presne, aké terény sú zahrnuté,\n"
"klikni pravým tlačidlom myši na pole a vyber <i>Popis terénu</i>."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:264
msgid ""
"But we can’t afford to give up too many villages either. We’ll have a hard "
"time recovering if our enemies’ gold reserves get out of hand."
msgstr ""
"Nemôžeme si však dovoliť vzdať sa príliš mnohých dedín. Budeme sa len ťažko "
"zotavovať, ak sa zásoby zlata našich nepriateľov vymknú spod kontroly."

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:267
msgid "Village Control"
msgstr "Kontrola dedín"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:268
msgid ""
"Remember that each village you own generates 1 gold per turn,\n"
"and supports 1 unit’s worth of upkeep. Level 2 units cost 2\n"
"upkeep, level 3 units cost 3 upkeep, etc. But level 0 units,\n"
"like Peasants and Woodsmen, cost no upkeep at all.\n"
"\n"
"<i><b>Enemies collect income and pay upkeep just like you do</b></i>,\n"
"so capturing just a small handful of villages from your\n"
"opponents can make a big difference."
msgstr ""
"Pamätaj, že každá dedina, ktorú vlastníš, generuje 1 zlato za kolo\n"
"a pokrýva žold 1 jednotky. Jednotky 2. úrovne stoja 2\n"
"žoldy, jednotky 3. úrovne 3 žoldy atď. Ale jednotky 0. úrovne,\n"
"ako sedliaci a horali, nestoja vôbec žiadny žold.\n"
"\n"
"<i><b>Nepriatelia zbierajú príjem a platia žold rovnako ako ty</b></i>,\n"
"takže obsadenie len niekoľkých dedín tvojim\n"
"súperom môže spraviť veľký rozdiel."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#. Thea is waiting for her brother Elyn to return, bringing merfolk soldiers to help fight
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:287
msgid ""
"I see movement on the horizon! Something is coming closer... it’ll reach us "
"in barely an hour. Is Elyn finally back?"
msgstr ""
"Vidím pohyb na obzore! Niečo sa približuje... dorazí k nám sotva za hodinu. "
"Vrátil sa už konečne Elyn?"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#. "two-legs" is meant to be a neutral (not insulting) term for humans
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:309
msgid ""
"Hail, two-legs! I see you are imperiled! I knew I smelled the stench of naga."
msgstr ""
"Zdravím, dvojnohí! Vidím, že ste v nebezpečenstve! Vedela som, že som cítila "
"pach hadích ľudí."

#. [message]: race=human
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:317
msgid "Hooray! The merfolk have come! Constable Elyn has brought the merfolk!"
msgstr "Hurá! Vodní ľudia prišli! Strážca Elyn priviedol vodných ľudí!"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:321
msgid ""
"Elyn? I know no such man. We come hunting a ship with black sails. It has "
"been the cause of much mischief in our waters."
msgstr ""
"Elyn? Žiadneho takého muža nepoznám. Lovíme loď s čiernymi plachtami. "
"Spôsobila v našich vodách veľa škody."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:325
msgid ""
"That’s the same ship that launched this attack on our village. But you say "
"my brother isn’t with you? What can have happened to him?"
msgstr ""
"To je tá istá loď, ktorá podnikla útok na našu dedinu. Ale hovoríte, že môj "
"brat nie je s vami? Čo sa mu mohlo stať?"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:329
msgid ""
"This is a matter for after the battle. First, we must aid you against these "
"vermin!"
msgstr "To vyriešime potom. Najskôr sa musíme vysporiadať s touto háveďou!"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:337
msgid "New Recruits"
msgstr "Noví regrúti"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:338
msgid ""
"Merman Fighters and Hunters are level 1 units: proper fighters, unlike your "
"untrained Peasants and Woodsmen."
msgstr ""
"Bojovníci a Lovci vodných ľudí sú jednotky 1. úrovne: skutoční bojovníci, na "
"rozdiel od vašich nevycvičených sedliakov a horalov."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:340
msgid ""
"Compared with level 1 Spearmen and Bowmen, Merman Fighters and Hunters have "
"improved defense (chance to evade) and speed, but lower damage."
msgstr ""
"V porovnaní s Kopijníkmi a Lučištníkmi 1. úrovne majú Bojovníci a Lovci "
"vodných ľudí lepšiu obranu (šancu na vyhnutie) a rýchlosť, ale nižšie "
"poškodenie."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. [objectives]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:352
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:355
msgid "Defeat the enemy leaders"
msgstr "Poraz nepriateľských vodcov"

#. [objective]: condition=lose
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:356
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:261
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:357
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:264
msgid "Death of Thea or Diondra"
msgstr "Smrť Thei alebo Diondry"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:411
msgid "Accursssed mermaid! We are lossst... I mussst essscape..."
msgstr "Prekliata morssská panna! Sssme sstratení... Musssím utiecť..."

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:428
msgid "Begone! Flee and cower in your dark caves and silent grottos!"
msgstr ""
"Zmiznite! Utečte a skryte sa vo svojich temných jaskyniach a tichých "
"mokradiach!"

#. [message]: race=human
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:436
msgid ""
"Thank you for helping us, mermaid of the bay! But what do we do now? Many of "
"us are hurt. Our leader is away at war, and our constable is missing — or "
"dead."
msgstr ""
"Ďakujeme za pomoc, morská panna zo zátoky! Ale čo budeme robiť teraz? Mnohí "
"z nás sú zranení. Náš vodca je preč vo vojne a náš strážca nezvestný, alebo "
"mŕtvy."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:440
msgid ""
"No, my brother couldn’t be... not like that. It’d take more than a few "
"snakes to kill Constable Elyn Nicolin. I know we’ll see him again."
msgstr ""
"Nie, môj brat nemôže byť... nie takto. Na zabitie stráźcu Elyna Nicolina by "
"bolo treba viac než len pár hadov. Viem, že ho ešte uvidíme."

#. [message]: race=human
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:448
msgid ""
"But he’s not here now. What happens the next time the pirates come, "
"Constable Thea?"
msgstr ""
"Ale teraz tu nie je. Čo sa stane, keď piráti prídu nabudúce, strážca Thea?"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:452
msgid "Constable Thea? I’m not— err..."
msgstr "Strážca Thea? Ja nie som, eee..."

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:454
msgid "Constable Thea"
msgstr "Strážca Thea"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:457
msgid "Alright. Mermaid, are you willing to take the fight to these pirates?"
msgstr "Do dobre. Morská panna, si ochotná bojovať s týmito pirátmi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:461
msgid ""
"Of course. The fleeing naga follow the coast south and west. I must go in "
"pursuit!"
msgstr ""
"Pravdaže. Utekajúci hadí ľudia idú pozdĺž pobrežia na juh a západ. Musím sa "
"pustiť za nimi!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#. "What do you say, lads?" echoes Rael's and Elyn's words earlier
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:466
msgid ""
"Then that is where we’ll go too. We won’t cower in fear until the next "
"attack, or wait for outside aid that may never come. We’re going to get out "
"there, hunt down that pirate lady and put an end to this! What do you say, "
"lads?"
msgstr ""
"Takže tam pôjdeme aj my. Nebudeme sa triasť zo strachu pred ďalším útokom, "
"ani čakať na pomoc zvonku, ktorá nemusí nikdy prísť. Pôjdeme tam, zabijeme "
"tú pirátsku dámu a učiníme tomu koniec! Čo poviete, chlapi?"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:491
msgid ""
"We will not fight here forever, villagers. The black ship is our real "
"quarry! Let us swiftly vanquish these naga and be done with it."
msgstr ""
"Nebudeme tu bojovať navždy, dedinčania. Čierna loď je náš skutočný cieľ! "
"Rýchlo porazme týchto hadích ľudí a budeme mať pokoj."

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/02_Swimming_with_Serpents.cfg:498
msgid ""
"I cannot fight on behalf of your village any longer, humans. I must pursue "
"the black ship before it escapes us! You will have to finish this battle "
"yourselves."
msgstr ""
"Už nemôžem bojovať za vašu dedinu, ľudia. Musím prenasledovať čiernu loď, "
"kým nám neunikne! Tento boj budete musieť dokončiť sami."

#. [scenario]: id=03_Desolation
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:9
msgid "Desolation"
msgstr "Pustošenie"

#. [part]
#. S03 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:24
msgid ""
"Under Thea’s command, the villagers appointed a handful of guards with "
"instructions to keep a watchful eye on the horizon. Should trouble return — "
"or Constable Elyn — they were to send a messenger immediately."
msgstr ""
"Pod Theiným velením dedinčania určili hŕstku strážcov s pokynom, aby pozorne "
"sledovali obzor. Ak by sa vrátili problémy, alebo strážca Elyn — mali ihneď "
"poslať posla."

#. [part]
#. S03 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:29
msgid ""
"The rest of the militia provisioned themselves and set off on foot. Guided "
"by the merfolk, they followed the coast, tracking the fleeing naga around "
"the Peninsula."
msgstr ""
"Zvyšok domobrany sa zásobil a vyrazil pešo. Vedení vodnými ľuďmi sledovali "
"pobrežie a stopovali utekajúcich hadích ľudí okolo polostrova."

#. [side]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:68
msgid "Wild Wolves"
msgstr "Divoké vlky"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:95
msgid "Stuxton"
msgstr "Stuxton"

#. [event]
#. [event]: id=immobile_derelict
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:144
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:279
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:209
msgid "Great White"
msgstr "Veľký biely"

#. [event]
#. [event]: id=immobile_derelict
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:145
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:284
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:210
msgid "The Garard"
msgstr "Garard"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#. "Your feet are lead" means that Thea is traveling too slowly.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:171
msgid ""
"Your feet are lead, woman of Rochelm. How can we pursue creatures of the "
"water when you are bound to land? Have you no swift gryphons or sleek boats "
"to carry you hence?"
msgstr ""
"Vaše postup je pomalý, žena z Rochelmu. Ako môžeme prenasledovať vodné "
"tvory, keď ste pripútaní k zemi? Nemáte žiadnych rýchlych gryfov, ani lode, "
"čo by vás odviezli?"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:175
msgid ""
"Good mermaid, most of us are farmers, not fishers. Elyn took our best "
"seaworthy boat, and— well, you know that story..."
msgstr ""
"Dobrá morská panna, väčšina z nás sú roľníci, nie rybári. Elyn si vzal našu "
"najlepšiu loď schopnú plavby na mori a... nuž, ten príbeh poznáš..."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:179
msgid ""
"But we’re almost upon the fishing village of Stuxton. Mayhaps they’ve had "
"trouble with pirates too. Even if they aren’t willing to join us, I’m sure "
"they’ll let us borrow of their fishing fleet."
msgstr ""
"Sme však už takmer v rybárskej dedine Stuxton. Možno mali problémy s pirátmi "
"aj oni. Aj keď by neboli ochotní pridať sa k nám, som si istá, že nám "
"dovolia požičať si časť ich rybárskej flotily."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:203
msgid "What?! Stuxton lies in ruins! Wolves feast on corpses in the streets!"
msgstr "Čo?! Stuxton je v troskách! Vlky sa na uliciach kŕmia mŕtvolami!"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:207
msgid ""
"There was clearly a battle here, one which has left several bodies. But most "
"of the village humans are unaccounted for. They are certainly not still "
"living here."
msgstr ""
"Očividne tu prebehla bitka, ktorá zanechala niekoľko tiel. Väčšina "
"dedinčanov je však nezvestná. Určite tu už nežijú."

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:211
msgid "Still here, however, are their boats. Get them, Thea."
msgstr "Stále sú tu však ich člny. Získaj ich, Thea."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:244
msgid ""
"I can do that. The two boats still afloat are damaged and taking on water. "
"We may have to split our forces if we want to claim both before they sink."
msgstr ""
"To zvládnem. Dva člny, ktoré sú stále na hladine, sú poškodené a naberajú "
"vodu. Možno budeme musieť rozdeliť sily, ak ich chceme získať obidva, kým sa "
"potopia."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:248
msgid ""
"This will be a quick expedition, but that doesn’t mean we should let down "
"our guard. The forest echoes with the howls of wolves..."
msgstr ""
"Bude to rýchla výprava, ale to neznamená, že by sme mali poľaviť v "
"ostražitosti. Lesom sa ozýva vytie vlkov..."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:256
msgid "Move any unit adjacent to both fishing skiffs"
msgstr "Presuň ľubovoľnú jednotku vedľa oboch rybárskych člnov"

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:285
msgid "What’s this? There’s a living man inside this wolf’s belly!"
msgstr "Čo je to? V bruchu tohto vlka je živý človek!"

#. [event]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:287
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Karkulka"

#. [message]: speaker=Red
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:290
msgid "By Haldric, I’m free!"
msgstr "Pri Haldricovi, som voľná!"

#. [message]: speaker=Red
#. This is a reference to the "Little Red Riding Hood" fairy tale
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:295
msgid ""
"I was supposed to be delivering tea to my poor sick grandmother. “<i>My, "
"what big teeth you have</i>”, I told her... and then my “grandmother” leapt "
"out of bed and swallowed me whole!"
msgstr ""
"Mala som doručiť čaj mojej úbohej chorej babičke. „<i>Aké veľké zuby máš</"
"i>“, povedala som jej... a potom moja „babička“ vyskočila z postele a "
"prehltla ma v celku!"

#. [message]: speaker=Red
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:299
msgid ""
"Tricked by a wolf, hrmph. I suppose I’ve nothing better to do now than to "
"join you. Perhaps someday I’ll write a popular children’s fable about my "
"harrowing experience..."
msgstr ""
"Oklamal ma vlk, grrr. Predpokladám, že teraz nemám nič lepšie na práci, než "
"sa k vám pridať. Možno raz napíšem populárnu detskú bájku o svojom otrasnom "
"zážitku..."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#. The player has defeated the wolf leader, but there may still be wolves on the map, and the scenario has not ended.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:306
msgid ""
"The worst of the wolves are dealt with, but we must still reach the last "
"boats before they sink."
msgstr ""
"S najhoršími vlkmi sme sa vyrovnali, ale stále musíme dosiahnuť posledné "
"člny, kým sa potopia."

#. [message]: speaker=$unit.id
#. The player is trying to reach two damaged skiffs before they sink. The player has reached the first one.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:324
msgid ""
"I’ve reached the first skiff! The damage doesn’t look bad. I think I can get "
"it seaworthy again."
msgstr ""
"Dosiahol som prvý čln! Nie je veľmi poškodený. Myslím, že ho dokážem opraviť."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:340
msgid "Halfway done, everyone. We’ll need both skiffs to carry us all."
msgstr "Sme v polovici, všetci. Budeme potrebovať oba člny, aby nás odviezli."

#. [message]: speaker=$unit.id
#. The player is trying to reach two damaged skiffs before they sink. The player has reached the second one.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:353
msgid ""
"I’m repairing the second skiff! There’s more bodies inside. It looks like a "
"family tried to hide here."
msgstr ""
"Opravujem druhý čln! Vnútri sú ďalšie telá. Vyzerá to, že sa tu snažila "
"ukryť rodina."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:377
msgid ""
"Pa used to take me here for festivals, back when. I knew some of these "
"dead... Was there anything we could have done?"
msgstr ""
"Otec ma sem kedysi vodieval na slávnosti. Poznala som niektorých z týchto "
"mŕtvych... Dalo sa niečo spraviť?"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:382
msgid "Forget it. Come on, everyone. Let’s get away from this dead place."
msgstr "Zabudnite na to. Poďme, všetci. Poďme preč z tohto mŕtveho miesta."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:405
msgid ""
"The boats are taking on too much water. We have to hurry and reach them "
"before they sink!"
msgstr "Člny naberajú príliš veľa vody. Musíme sa ponáhľať, kým sa potopia!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:411
msgid ""
"The last boat is taking on too much water. We have to hurry and reach it "
"before it sinks!"
msgstr ""
"Posledný čln naberá príliš veľa vody. Musíme sa ponáhľať, kým sa potopí!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:427
msgid ""
"The last boats have sunk! Without boats we can’t keep up with the merfolk. "
"You’ll have to go ahead without us, Diondra..."
msgstr ""
"Posledné člny sa potopili! Bez člnov nestačíme vodným ľuďom. Budete musieť "
"ísť napred bez nás, Diondra..."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/03_Desolation.cfg:433
msgid ""
"The last boat has sunk! Without both boats we can’t keep up with the "
"merfolk. You’ll have to go ahead without us, Diondra..."
msgstr ""
"Posledný čln sa potopil! Bez oboch člnov nestačíme vodným ľuďom. Budete "
"musieť ísť napred bez nás, Diondra..."

#. [scenario]: id=04_Lee_Shore
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:9
msgid "Lee Shore"
msgstr "Záveterné pobrežie"

#. [part]
#. S04 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:25
msgid ""
"The villagers boarded their new ships and set sail. The skill of their "
"merfolk escorts more than compensated for the inexperience of the sailors, "
"and the makeshift flotilla made good time around the cape."
msgstr ""
"Dedinčania nastúpili na svoje nové lode a vyplávali. Zručnosť ich sprievodu "
"z radov vodných ľudí viac než vykompenzovala neskúsenosť námorníkov a "
"provizŕna flotila sa rýchlo dostala k mysu."

#. [part]
#. S04 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:30
msgid ""
"They passed several other small hamlets. Like Stuxton, all were empty, and "
"marred by signs of weeks-old battle. Finally, five days after leaving home, "
"the villagers and merfolk sighted signs of activity on the coast."
msgstr ""
"Míňali niekoľko ďalších malých osád. Podobne ako Stuxton, všetky boli "
"prázdne a poznačené bojom. Napokon, päť dní po opustení domova, dedinčania a "
"vodní ľudia spozorovali na pobreží známky aktivity."

#. [leader]: type=Outlaw, id=leader2
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:58
msgid "Havan"
msgstr "Havan"

#. [leader]: type=Huntsman, id=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:83
msgid "Rhaddin"
msgstr "Rhaddin"

#. [message]: speaker=leader4
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:257
msgid ""
"Sssmall boatsss are coming! I sssussspect these are sssurvivors from that "
"last hovel; the onesss who hurt me. I am sssure they are here to caussse "
"problemsss."
msgstr ""
"Malé člny prichádzajú! Mám podozrenie, že sssú to tí, čo prežili z tamtej "
"possslednej chatrče. Tí, čo mi ublížili. Sssom sssi issstý, že sssú tu, aby "
"ssspôsobovali problémy."

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#. "The Lady" refers to Lady Maudie, the main villain of this campaign.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:262
msgid ""
"The Lady won’t be happy if any of our trainees escape, especially not with "
"the invasion so near."
msgstr ""
"Pani nebude nadšená, ak niekto z našich učňov utečie, najmä nie keď je "
"invázia tak blízko."

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:266
msgid ""
"Call off the dive! Chattel, back to your quarters. Corsairs, get ready to "
"fight!"
msgstr ""
"Odvolajte potápanie! Chattel, vráť sa do kajuty. Ostatní, pripravte sa na "
"boj!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:302
msgid ""
"Here are the missing villagers — in chains! Would this have been our fate if "
"not for your intervention, Diondra?"
msgstr ""
"Tu sú tí chýbajúci dedinčania... v reťaziach! Bol by toto náš osud, nebyť "
"tvojho zásahu, Diondra?"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:306
msgid ""
"I think the prisoners are being forced to... dive for pearls? But there "
"aren’t any pearls on this part of the coast."
msgstr ""
"Myslím, že väzni sú nútení... potápať sa za perlami? Ale na tejto časti "
"pobrežia žiadne perly nie sú."

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:310
msgid ""
"Perhaps this is not the slaves’ final home. A grim omen. It sounds almost as "
"if they mean to conquer the Bay of Pearls itself."
msgstr ""
"Možno ich plánujú premiestniť. Zlé znamenie. Znie to takmer tak, ako by "
"chceli dobiť samotnú Perlovú zátoku."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:314
msgid "Is that possible?!"
msgstr "Je to možné?!"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:318
msgid ""
"My city nurtures the continent’s largest and wealthiest merfolk population, "
"yet most of us are not warriors. With Wesnoth’s army away at war in the "
"east, I think it unlikely but not impossible for a coordinated group of "
"corsairs to take control."
msgstr ""
"Moje mesto má najväčšiu a najbohatšiu populáciu vodných ľudí na kontinete, "
"no väčšina z nás nie sú bojovníci. Keďže armáda Wesnothu je vo vojne na "
"východe, považujem za nepravdepodobné, ale nie nemožné, aby zorganizovaná "
"skupina korzárov prevzala kontrolu."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:322
msgid "An invading army. And our neighbors enslaved! We can’t abide this."
msgstr "Invázna armáda. A naši susedia zotročení! Toto nemôžeme strpieť."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:326
msgid ""
"Grab your weapons, everyone. Free every prisoner... but take none ourselves."
msgstr ""
"Do zbrane, všetci. Osloboďte každého väzňa... ale sami neberte žiadnych."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:352
msgid "($cages.length remaining)"
msgstr "(zostáva $cages.length)"

#. [objective]: condition=win
#. $cages.length will be between 1 and 20
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:352
msgid "Free the imprisoned slaves"
msgstr "Osloboď uväznených otrokov"

#. [note]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:366
msgid "Attack and break a cage to free the slave inside."
msgstr "Zaútoč na klietku a rozbi ju, aby si oslobodili otroka vnútri."

#. [message]: speaker=second_unit
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:384
msgid "Hah! You missed me!"
msgstr "Hah! Netrafil si ma!"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:387
msgid "Elusive Enemies"
msgstr "Unikajúci nepriatelia"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:388
msgid ""
"Not all units are created equal. As you know, fighters like naga or merfolk "
"have high defense (chance\n"
"to evade) in water, but pay for that strength by having low defense while on "
"land.\n"
"\n"
"Other units, like the Footpad you just attacked, have abnormally high "
"defense <b><i>everywhere</i></b>. That’s a major\n"
"strength, but comes at the cost of poor damage output and vulnerability to "
"most damage types.\n"
"\n"
"To see a unit’s terrain defence and damage resistances/vulnerabilities, "
"<b><i>right-click on it and select \n"
"“Unit Type Description.”</i></b>"
msgstr ""
"Nie všetky jednotky sú rovnaké. Ako isto vieš, bojovníci ako hadí ľudia, "
"alebo vodní ľudia majú vysokú obranu (šancu\n"
"na vyhnutie) vo vode, ale za túto silu platia nízkou obranou na súši.\n"
"\n"
"Iné jednotky, ako Poskok, na ktorého si práve zaútočil, majú abnormálne "
"vysokú obranu <b><i>všade</i></b>. To je veľká\n"
"prednosť, ale prichádza za cenu slabého poškodenia a zraniteľnosti voči "
"väčšine typov poškodenia.\n"
"\n"
"Ak chceš vidieť obranu jednotky v teréne a jej odolnosť/zraniteľnosť voči "
"poškodeniu, <b><i>klikni na ňu pravým tlačidlom \n"
"myši a vyber „Popis typu jednotky“.</i></b>"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. The player has just freed a slave from his cage.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:407
msgid "What’s happening? Is that... Thea? Alderman Rael’s daughter?"
msgstr "Čo sa deje? Je to... Thea? Dcéra rychtára Raela?"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:411
msgid ""
"We come to free you from your bonds, human. These pirates took you from your "
"home. Now take from them their lives."
msgstr ""
"Prišli sme vás oslobodiť. Títo piráti vás vzali z vášho domova. Teraz im "
"vezmite ich životy."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. The player has just freed a slave from his cage.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:418
msgid "They burned my whole village! I want revenge!"
msgstr "Vypálili celú moju dedinu! Chcem pomstu!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. The player has just freed a slave from his cage.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:425
msgid ""
"Thank you! These pirates lock us up whenever they aren’t forcing us to "
"dive..."
msgstr "Ďakujem! Títo piráti nás väznia a nútia nás sa potápať..."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:445
msgid "We’re almost finished. There’s only a few more prisoners left to free."
msgstr "Sme takmer na konci. Zostáva oslobodiť už len niekoľko väzňov."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. An enemy leader is dying.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:463
msgid "No!"
msgstr "Nie!"

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. An enemy leader is dying.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:478
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "Argh..."

#. [message]: speaker=unit
#. An enemy naga leader is dying.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:493
msgid "Hisss..."
msgstr "Hisss..."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:518
msgid ""
"The outlaw leaders are dead! Time to release the rest of their prisoners."
msgstr "Vodcovia psancov sú mŕtvi! Je čas oslobodiť zvyšok ich väzňov."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:541
msgid "Well done, everyone! We’ve freed all of the pirates’ prisoners."
msgstr "Výborne, všetci! Oslobodili sme všetkých väzňov pirátov."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:548
msgid ""
"With so many new farmers and fishers swelling our ranks, we finally have the "
"numbers we need to field more human fighters."
msgstr ""
"Keďže naše rady sa rozšírili o tak veľa nových farmárov a rybárov, konečne "
"máme viac posíl potrebných na nasadenie v boji."

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:557
msgid "Additional Manpower"
msgstr "Dodatočná posily"

#. [object]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:558
msgid "Peasants and Woodsmen no longer cost twice as much to recruit."
msgstr "Sedliaci a horali už pri naverbovaní nestoja dvakrát viac."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:574
msgid "What’s this? An unruly mob in place of my orderly divers?"
msgstr "Čo je to? Neposlušný dav namiesto mojich podriadených potápačov?"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#. "trainees" refers to new slaves. "dispose of them" means to kill them.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:579
msgid ""
"My, my. How unlucky. I had meant to introduce some new trainees I’d "
"acquired... but given the present state of affairs, I suppose I’ll have to "
"dispose of them instead."
msgstr ""
"Ale ale, pozrime, aké nešťastie. Chcela som predstaviť nových učňov, ktorých "
"som získala... ale vzhľadom na súčasný stav vecí sa ich namiesto toho asi "
"budem musieť zbaviť."

#. [message]: role=prisoner1
#. A prisoner is being made to walk the plank (which will kill them).
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:589
msgid "No, wait—"
msgstr "Nie, počkaj..."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:593
msgid "Walk the plank!"
msgstr "Choď na dosku!"

#. [message]: role=prisoner2
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:602
msgid "I can’t swim, please—"
msgstr "Neviem plávať, prosím..."

#. [message]: race=human
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:643
msgid "Look! That’s the constable!"
msgstr "Pozrite! To je strážca!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:648
msgid "Elyn! My brother!"
msgstr "Elyn! Môj brat!"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:661
msgid ""
"Ta ta, dears. This was unfortunate, but really, I had no choice. There’s no "
"room for freeloaders on my ship."
msgstr ""
"Zbohom, drahí. Boli to nešťastné udalosti, ale naozaj som nemala na výber. "
"Na mojej lodi nie je miesto pre príživníkov."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#. "fish-tailed sweethearts" refers to the merfolk. Maudie doesn't acknowledge the human villagers as a meaningful adversary.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:666
msgid ""
"You see, there’s a new power growing in these parts: me. It’s time for Lady "
"Maudie to take back what she’s owed. I’ll see you fish-tailed sweethearts "
"again real soon."
msgstr ""
"Viete, v týchto končinách rastie nová moc: ja. Je čas, aby si Lady Maudie "
"vzala späť to, čo jej patrí. Čoskoro sa opäť uvidíme, moje rybochvosté "
"zlatíčka."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:676
msgid ""
"Elyn!! My brother can swim, but not for long in this surf! Diondra, you have "
"to rescue him! Rescue them all!"
msgstr ""
"Elyn!! Môj brat vie plávať, ale v týchto vlnách nie dlho! Diondra, musíte ho "
"zachrániť! Zachráňte ich všetkých!"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:764
msgid ""
"I am sorry, Thea. His arms and legs were bound... I’ve retrieved only a "
"corpse. The pirates must’ve captured him while he sailed in search of help."
msgstr ""
"Je mi to ľúto, Thea. Ruky aj nohy mal zviazané... Vytiahla som len mŕtvolu. "
"Piráti ho museli zajať, kým sa plavil a hľadal pomoc."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:768
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:772
msgid ""
"Do not let his death be in vain. We must catch this “Maudie” and bring her "
"to justice. Follow the black ship!"
msgstr ""
"Nenechajte jeho smrť vyjsť nazmar. Musíme túto „Maudie“ chytiť a predviesť "
"pred spravodlivosť. Nasledujte čiernu loď!"

#. [message]: speaker=Diondra
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:790
msgid ""
"Do not delay, Thea. These pirates are planning something. If we cannot "
"finish our battle here, I fear they will be reinforced, and us overwhelmed."
msgstr ""
"Neotáľaj, Thea. Títo piráti niečo chystajú. Ak tu nedokončíme náš boj, "
"obávam sa, že dostanú posily a my budeme porazení."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:804
msgid "What’s this? An unruly mob harassing my divers?"
msgstr "Čo je to? Neposlušný dav, ktorý obťažuje mojich potápačov?"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:808
msgid ""
"Now now, we can’t be having that. Luckily for me, you’ve given me enough "
"time to prepare a whole fleet of warships, all filled to the brim with angry "
"outlaws."
msgstr ""
"No tak, to predsa nemôžeme dopustiť. Našťastie pre mňa ste mi dali dostatok "
"času na prípravu celej flotily vojnových lodí plných nahnevaných psancov."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/04_Lee_Shore.cfg:816
msgid ""
"The merfolk aren’t prepared to battle such a large fleet! We have to flee "
"before we’re destroyed..."
msgstr ""
"Vodní ľudia nie sú pripravení bojovať s takou veľkou flotilou! Musíme "
"utiecť, lebo nás zničia..."

#. [scenario]: id=05_Lady_Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:6
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/utils/characters.cfg:91
msgid "Lady Maudie"
msgstr "Lady Maudie"

#. [part]
#. S05 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:23
msgid ""
"The villagers held a sombre shipboard funeral for Constable Elyn, and a "
"burial at sea. The alderman’s son had always been there for them... until "
"suddenly he wasn’t."
msgstr ""
"Dedinčania usporiadali na palube lode ponurý pohreb pre stráźcu Elyna a "
"pochovali ho do mora. Rychtárov syn tu pre nich bol vždy až do smrti."

#. [part]
#. S05 intro. Thea's father left many months ago, along with other villagers.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:28
msgid ""
"Not for the first time, Thea worried about her father; about all those who’d "
"gone to war. She’d heard stories, of course — but experiencing battle and "
"loss herself was something else entirely."
msgstr ""
"Nebolo to prvýkrát, čo sa Thea strachovala o svojho otca. O všetkých tých, "
"ktorí odišli do vojny. Pravdaže, počula príbehy, ale zažiť boj a stratu na "
"vlastnej koži bolo niečo úplne iné."

#. [part]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:30
msgid ""
"She wondered how her father could so readily return to something so grim. "
"She wondered what drives “Lady Maudie” to inflict it upon others."
msgstr ""
"Aké to muselo byť pre jej otca, tak ochotne sa vrátiť k niečomu takému "
"pochmúrnemu. Premýšľala, čo ženie „Lady Maudie“, aby spôsobovala iným smrť a "
"utrpenie."

#. [part]
#. S05 intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:35
msgid ""
"Guided by merfolk, the flotilla kept station several dozen miles behind "
"Maudie’s ship; too slow to catch her, but fast enough to stay in sight. "
"Maudie’s destination soon became apparent: the wild, unsettled islands known "
"as the Three Sisters."
msgstr ""
"Flotila, vedená vodnými ľuďmi, sa držala niekoľko desiatok míľ za Maudiinou "
"loďou. Príliš pomalá na to, aby ju dobehla, no dosť rýchla na to, aby ju "
"mala stále na dohľad. Maudiin cieľ bol čoskoro jasný: divoké, neobývané "
"ostrovy známe ako Tri sestry."

#. [leader]: type=Assassin, id=leader2, gender=female
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:55
msgid "Analla"
msgstr "Analla"

#. [leader]: type=Ranger, id=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:81
msgid "Shipmaster Derryn"
msgstr "Kapitán Derryn"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:161
msgid ""
"This island is covered in villages. Even if we don’t need the gold "
"ourselves, we should still make sure Maudie doesn’t take so many that we "
"become overwhelmed."
msgstr ""
"Tento ostrov je plný dedín. Aj keď sami zlato nepotrebujeme, stále by sme sa "
"mali uistiť, že ich Maudie nezaberie toľko, aby nás premohla."

#. [message]: speaker=narrator
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:166
msgid ""
"To see how much gold and income your enemies have, press <i>Alt+S</i>, or "
"open the Menu and select “Status Table”."
msgstr ""
"Ak chceš zistiť, koľko zlata a príjmu majú tvoji nepriatelia, stlač "
"<i>Alt+S</i> alebo otvor Ponuku a vyber „Tabuľka stavu“."

#. [event]: id=immobile_derelict
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:177
msgid "Makeshift Shipyard"
msgstr "Provizórna lodenica"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#. "fish" is meant to be an insulting way to refer to merfolk
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:228
msgid ""
"Tut-tut, the mermaid followed me all this way? Show some deference, fish. "
"Soon you’ll be calling me your lord."
msgstr ""
"Ale čo? Morská panna ma sledovala až sem? Prejav trochu úcty, ryba. Čoskoro "
"ma budeš volať svojím pánom."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:232
msgid ""
"It’s not just merfolk who followed you here. I’m here to avenge my brother, "
"you soulless murderer!"
msgstr ""
"Nie sú to len vodní ľudia, ktorí vás sem sledovali. Som tu, aby som pomstila "
"svojho brata, ty bezduchá vrahyňa!"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:236
msgid "My, such language. Who in the world are you talking about?"
msgstr "Páni, taký slovník. O kom to preboha hovoríš?"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:240
msgid "My brother! The mustached javelineer you drowned not two days ago?"
msgstr ""
"Môj brat! Ten fúzatý oštepár, ktorého si utopila nie je to ani dva dni?"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:244
msgid ""
"I’m sorry, sweetie, you smallfolk all look the same to me. But if you’re so "
"beaten up about his death, I’d be happy to help you join him. Shipmaster, is "
"my fleet ready?"
msgstr ""
"Prepáč zlatíčko, vy prostí ľudia mi všetci pripadáte rovnakí. Ale ak ťa jeho "
"smrť tak trápi, rada ti pomôžem pridať sa k nemu. Kapitán, je moja flotila "
"pripravená?"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:248
msgid ""
"Not yet, milady. As we’ve discussed, repairing derelicts takes quite some "
"time. It might still be weeks—"
msgstr ""
"Ešte nie, pani moja. Ako sme sa rozprávali, oprava vrakov trvá pomerne dlho. "
"Môže to trvať ešte týždne..."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:252
msgid ""
"Yes, yes, I remember now. Just... deal with these peasants, will you? That "
"business with the freed prisoners has given me a terrible headache. I’m "
"really not in the mood to entertain riff-raff."
msgstr ""
"Áno, áno, už si spomínam. Len... vyrieš to s týmito sedliakmi, dobre? Z tej "
"záležitosti s oslobodenými väzňami ma strašne bolí hlava. Naozaj nemám "
"náladu sa zaoberať chátrou."

#. [objective]: condition=win
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:260
msgid "Defeat Lady Maudie"
msgstr "Porazte Lady Maudie"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:296
msgid ""
"They’re getting closer. Shipmaster, how long until the fleet is finished?!"
msgstr "Dostávajú sa bližšie. Kapitán, kedy už bude flotila hotová?!"

#. [message]: speaker=leader3
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:300
msgid "Madam, I’ve told you, it might still be weeks—"
msgstr "Pani moja, vravel som vám, že to môže trvať ešte týždne..."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:306
msgid ""
"They’re getting closer. And my shipmaster got himself killed... Do I have to "
"do everything myself?"
msgstr ""
"Dostávajú sa bližšie. A môj kapitán sa nechal zabiť... To musím všetko robiť "
"sama?"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:312
msgid ""
"Fine! Since these ships cannot serve me in any useful capacity, set them "
"ablaze and send them to run down anything in the water!"
msgstr ""
"Dobre teda! Keď mi tieto lode nemôžu slúžiť, zapáľte ich a pošlite, nech "
"zničia všetko, čo je vo vode!"

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:329
msgid "Know Thy Enemy"
msgstr "Poznaj svojho nepriateľa"

#. [display_tip]
#. knowing about the Fireship specifically isn't that important (although it does make it clear that this isn't a bug). But the Fireship is a good example about how knowing an enemy's weaknesses can make them much easier to fight. This also makes exploiting the Fireships feel less like a mistake ("oh, the AI is dumb"), and makes it clear that making them exploitable like this is a deliberate design choice
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:331
msgid "A unit’s statistics determine the best strategy for fighting them."
msgstr "Štatistiky jednotky určujú najlepšiu stratégiu boja proti nej."

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:333
msgid ""
"Maudie’s new fireships, for example, can deal massive damage in\n"
"melee combat. But their <i>deteriorate</i> ability drains their health\n"
"every turn, and being ships they cannot chase you onto land."
msgstr ""
"Maudiine nové ohnivé lode môžu napríklad spôsobiť masívne poškodenie v\n"
"boji nablízko. Ale ich schopnosť <i>chátranie</i> im každé kolo uberá\n"
"zdravie a keďže sú to lode, nemôžu ťa prenasledovať na súš."

#. [display_tip]
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:337
msgid ""
"While many units are general-purpose, others — like the Fireship — \n"
"have clear strengths and weaknesses. If you haven’t been doing so\n"
"already, consider checking new units’ stats to identify any\n"
"weaknesses they may have."
msgstr ""
"Zatiaľ, čo mnohé jednotky sú univerzálne, iné, ako napríklad \n"
"horiaca loď, majú jasné silné a slabé stránky. Ak si tak doteraz \n"
"nerobil, skontroluj štatistiky nových jednotiek, aby si odhalil ich\n"
"prípadné slabiny."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#. Princess Bride movie reference
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:358
msgid "My name is Thea Nicolin. You killed my brother! Prepare to die!!"
msgstr "Volám sa Thea Nicolin. Zabila si mi brata! Priprav sa na smrť!!"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#. "you're all leeches" echoes the S01 leader's dying words
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:376
msgid ""
"Get away from my ship, you low-born churl! You’re all just leeches! The Bay "
"should be <i>mine</i>, not yours!"
msgstr ""
"Preč od mojej lode, ty podradná svoloč! Všetci ste len pijavice! Zátoka má "
"byť <i>moja</i>, nie vaša!"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#. "you're all leeches" echoes the S01 leader's dying words
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:383
msgid ""
"Get away from my ship, you filthy fish! You’re all just leeches! The Bay "
"should be <i>mine</i>, not yours!"
msgstr ""
"Preč od mojej lode, ty špinavá ryba! Všetci ste len pijavice! Zátoka má byť "
"<i>moja</i>, nie vaša!"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:389
msgid ""
"It belongs to me and my blood by right! My noble ancestors fought our way to "
"the top, and we would have stayed there if those idiot kings hadn’t stolen "
"it from us and given it to the merfolk instead."
msgstr ""
"Patrí právom mne! Moji vznešení predkovia sa vypracovali na vrchol a my by "
"sme tam zostali, keby nám ju tí idioti králi neukradli a nedali namiesto "
"toho vodným ľuďom."

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:393
msgid ""
"You’re talking about when the Bay was first awarded to the merfolk? But that "
"was over three hundred years ago!"
msgstr ""
"Hovoríš o časoch, keď bola Zátoka prvýkrát pridelená vodným ľuďom? Ale to "
"bolo pred viac ako tristo rokmi!"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:397
msgid ""
"And my line <i>has not forgotten</i>! It should have been <i>me</i> who "
"inherited the pearls!"
msgstr ""
"A môj rod <i>nezabudol</i>! Mala som to byť <i>ja</i>, kto zdedil perly!"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:399
msgid ""
"Eating caviar instead of hardtack, served by slaves instead of outlaws, "
"living in a villa instead of a smelly, grungy, fish-smelling pirate ship... "
"oh, I’m going to be seasick again..."
msgstr ""
"Jesť kaviár namiesto suchárov, obsluhovaná otrokmi namiesto zbojníkov, žiť "
"vo vile namiesto rybacinou zapáchajúcej, ulepenej pirátskej lodi... och, asi "
"mi budem mať zase morskú nemoc..."

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:409
msgid ""
"But you’re just a bunch of fish and smallfolk! It’s my right to rule! How— I "
"mean... well, surely you can’t fault a girl for having ambition?"
msgstr ""
"Ale vy ste len banda rýb a prostého ľudu! Je to moje právo vládnuť! "
"Ja...chcem povedať... predsa nemôžete dievčaťu vyčítať, že má ambície, nie?"

#. [message]: speaker=Maudie
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:433
msgid "We’re sinking. Someone, stop the sinking! No. No! I can’t swim!!"
msgstr "Potápame sa. Zastavte to niekto! Nie. Nie! Ja neviem plávať!!"

#. [message]: speaker=Thea
#. Echoing Maudie's lines from S04 and S02.
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/05_Lady_Maudie.cfg:440
msgid "(grim) Ta ta."
msgstr "(pochmúrne) Pá pá."

#. [scenario]: id=06_Epilogue
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/06_Epilogue.cfg:6
msgid "Epilogue"
msgstr "Epilóg"

#. [part]
#. epilogue intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/06_Epilogue.cfg:13
msgid ""
"With Maudie defeated, her surviving supporters scattered, hotly pursued by "
"Diondra and her merfolk. The villagers worked to dismantle and loot the "
"pirate shipyard, then set sail once more for their home, where they were "
"greeted with a resounding cheer."
msgstr ""
"Po porážke Maudie sa jej druhovia, ktorí prežili, rozpŕchli, zatiaľ čo ich "
"Diondra a jej vodní ľudia horlivo prenasledovali. Dedinčania rozobrali a "
"vyrabovali pirátsku lodenicu a potom opäť vyplávali do svojho domova, kde "
"ich privítal hlučný jasot."

#. [part]
#. epilogue intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/06_Epilogue.cfg:18
msgid ""
"The neighboring hamlets, briefly pillaged and empty, started to refill with "
"their newly-freed inhabitants. Many had died in the pirate raids, but many "
"more had lived, and what remained of Lady Maudie’s fleet now made for rich "
"plunder. Constable Thea took it upon herself to distribute food and "
"supplies, and soon became the de-facto leader of the Peninsula’s human "
"community."
msgstr ""
"Susedné osady, ktoré boli krátku dobu vyplienené a prázdne, sa začali opäť "
"napĺňať svojimi novonadobudnutými slobodnými obyvateľmi. Mnohí pri "
"pirátskych nájazdoch zahynuli, ale ešte viac ich prežilo a to, čo zostalo z "
"flotily Lady Maudie, sa stalo bohatou korisťou. Stražca Thea vzala na seba "
"rozdávanie jedla a zásob a čoskoro sa stala vodkyňou ľudskej komunity na "
"Polostrove."

#. [part]
#. epilogue intro. The "next serious threat" is Asheviere's orcs' takeover, as seen in HttT
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/06_Epilogue.cfg:23
msgid ""
"Untouched by the fighting, the merfolk city at the Bay of Pearls continued "
"to prosper. It would be many decades until the next serious threat."
msgstr ""
"Bojmi nedotknuté mesto vodných ľudí v Perlovej zátoke naďalej prosperovalo. "
"Trvalo by mnoho desaťročí, kým by prišla ďalšia vážna hrozba."

#. [part]
#. epilogue intro
#: data/campaigns/Of_Pearls_and_Pirates/scenarios/06_Epilogue.cfg:28
msgid ""
"Finally, many years later, Alderman Rael and his much-diminished warband "
"made a weary return to Rochelm, their tour of duty complete. Thea’s father "
"spoke grimly; of orc and lizard, siege and ambush. But that story — King "
"Garard’s war — is a tale for another hero..."
msgstr ""
"Napokon, o mnoho rokov neskôr, keď dokončili svoju službu, sa rychtár Rael a "
"jeho značne preriedená družina unavene vrátili do Rochelmu, . Thein otec "
"hovoril pochmúrne; o orkoch a jašteroch, obliehaní a prepade. Ale ten "
"príbeh, vojna kráľa Gararda, je príbehom pre iného hrdinu..."

